---
import { contentLicenseUrl } from '../data/footer';
import { Icon } from '@astrojs/starlight/components';

interface Props { kind: 'reading' | 'license'; }
const { kind } = Astro.props;
const feedbackHref = `/feedback/?page=${encodeURIComponent(Astro.url.pathname)}`;
---

<div class:list={['content-notices', `content-notices--${kind}`]} data-pagefind-ignore>
	{kind === 'license' && <details class="license-details">
		<summary>
			<span class="notice-copy">
				<span class="note-intro">原创内容以 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 许可</span>
			</span>
			<span class="notice-more">许可详情 <Icon name="down-caret" size="0.875rem" /></span>
		</summary>
		<div class="disclosure-content"><dl class="notice-body">
			<div>
				<dt>原创内容</dt>
				<dd>除另有注明及第三方材料外，本站原创内容采用 <a href={contentLicenseUrl} rel="license">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a> 许可协议。转载、传播或改编时，应保留作者署名、来源及许可链接，并注明所作修改；不得用于商业目的，改编作品须以相同许可共享。具体条件以许可协议为准。</dd>
			</div>
			<div>
				<dt>学校文件与第三方材料</dt>
				<dd>学校及其他第三方发布的文件、通知，以及引用的文字、图片和附件等材料，不属于本站 CC 许可的授权范围。相关权利归原权利人所有，使用时应保留来源与版权信息，并遵循原始来源的授权条件；需要另行取得授权的，应向权利人申请。如涉及署名、授权等权利问题，请权利人发送邮件至 <a href="mailto:wiki@snc.moe">wiki@snc.moe</a>，并提供原始来源、权利证明及相关说明，以便核查处理。</dd>
			</div>
		</dl></div>
	</details>}

	{kind === 'reading' && <div class="disclaimer-details">
		<div class="reading-intro">
			<span class="notice-copy">
				<span class="note-intro"><strong>本站内容仅供参考</strong>，相关事项以学校最新正式通知为准。</span>
			</span>
			<button class="notice-more reading-toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="reading-details">详细说明 <Icon name="down-caret" size="0.875rem" /></button>
		</div>
		<div id="reading-details" class="reading-panel" hidden><div class="disclosure-content"><div class="notice-body">
			<p>BUCT Wiki 为学生共同维护的校园信息与经验分享平台，非学校或相关部门的官方信息发布渠道。本站对文件、通知及办事流程的整理与解读仅供参考，具体事项应以原始文件及相关部门的正式答复为准。</p>
			<p>本站内容可能因政策调整、适用条件差异或更新滞后而与实际情况不一致。涉及报名、申请、缴费等具体事项，使用者应核对学校及相关部门的最新正式通知，必要时向相关部门确认。</p>
			<p>内容勘误、意见建议及其他一般事项，可通过<a href={feedbackHref}>内容反馈</a>或发送邮件至 <a href="mailto:wiki@snc.moe">wiki@snc.moe</a> 与本站联系；涉及署名、授权等权利问题，请权利人通过上述邮箱提交相关材料及说明，以便核查处理。</p>
		</div></div></div>
	</div>}
</div>

<script>
	const readingToggle = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('.reading-toggle');
	const readingDetails = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#reading-details');
	readingToggle?.addEventListener('click', () => {
		if (!readingDetails) return;
		readingDetails.hidden = !readingDetails.hidden;
		readingToggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(!readingDetails.hidden));
	});
</script>

<style>
	.content-notices {
		color: var(--md-sys-color-on-surface-variant);
		font-size: 0.875rem;
		line-height: 1.85;
	}
	.content-notices--license { margin-top: 0.75rem; font-size: 0.8125rem; }
	.content-notices--reading {
		padding-inline: 1.25rem;
		border-inline-start: 3px solid var(--md-sys-color-primary);
		border-radius: var(--md-sys-shape-sm);
		background: var(--md-sys-color-primary-container);
		color: var(--md-sys-color-on-primary-container);
	}
	:global(:root[data-theme='light']) .content-notices--reading { background: var(--md-sys-color-surface-container-low); }
	.reading-intro { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; padding-block: 0.5rem; }
	.reading-toggle { justify-self: end; min-height: 2.75rem; margin-inline: 0 -0.75rem; padding: 0.375rem 0.75rem; border: 0; border-radius: var(--md-sys-shape-sm); background: transparent; font-family: inherit; line-height: 1.5; cursor: pointer; }
	.reading-toggle:hover { background: color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 8%, transparent); }
	.reading-toggle:active { background: color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 12%, transparent); }
	.reading-toggle:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--md-sys-color-primary); outline-offset: 3px; }
	.reading-toggle[aria-expanded='true'] :global(svg) { transform: rotate(180deg); }
	.reading-panel {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-rows: 1fr;
		opacity: 1;
		transition: grid-template-rows 200ms ease, opacity 200ms ease, display 200ms allow-discrete;
	}
	.reading-panel[hidden] { display: none; grid-template-rows: 0fr; opacity: 0; }
	@starting-style {
		.reading-panel:not([hidden]) { grid-template-rows: 0fr; opacity: 0; }
	}
	.content-notices--reading strong { font-weight: 600; }
	/* Keep the expanded note's bottom spacing inside its background. */
	.content-notices--reading .notice-body { margin-bottom: 0; padding-bottom: 1.25rem; color: var(--md-sys-color-on-primary-container); }
	details::details-content {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-rows: 0fr;
		opacity: 0;
		transition: grid-template-rows 200ms ease, opacity 200ms ease, content-visibility 200ms allow-discrete;
	}
	details[open]::details-content { grid-template-rows: 1fr; opacity: 1; }
	.disclosure-content { min-height: 0; overflow: hidden; margin-inline: -0.5rem; padding-inline: 0.5rem; }
	summary { display: block; box-sizing: border-box; min-height: 2.75rem; padding: 0.5rem 0; border-radius: 0.25rem; list-style: none; cursor: pointer; }
	summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
	.notice-copy { display: inline; }
	.note-intro { font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; }
	.notice-more { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.25rem; color: var(--md-sys-color-primary); font-size: 0.8125rem; white-space: nowrap; }
	.license-details .notice-more { margin-inline-start: 0.5rem; }
	.notice-more :global(svg) { transition: transform 200ms ease; }
	details[open] .notice-more :global(svg) { transform: rotate(180deg); }
	summary:hover .notice-more { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 0.2em; }
	summary:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--md-sys-color-primary); outline-offset: 3px; }
	dl { display: grid; gap: 1rem; }
	.notice-body { margin: 0.75rem 0 1.25rem; font-size: 0.875rem; }
	.notice-body p { margin: 0; }
	.notice-body p + p { margin-top: 1rem; }
	dl > div { display: grid; gap: 0.5rem; }
	dt { color: var(--md-sys-color-on-surface); font-weight: 600; }
	dd { margin: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
	a { color: var(--sl-color-text-accent); text-underline-offset: 0.2em; }
	a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
	a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--sl-color-text-accent); outline-offset: 3px; }
	@media (max-width: 35rem) {
		.content-notices--reading { padding-inline: 1rem; }
		.reading-intro { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 0; }
	}
	@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
		details::details-content, .reading-panel, .notice-more :global(svg) { transition: none; }
	}
	@media print {
		.content-notices--reading { padding-inline: 0; border: 0; background: none; }
		summary { padding-inline: 0; }
		.notice-more { display: none; }
	}
</style>
